[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sifu-Hotman/More-Mod-Patches-for-Expanded-Materials-Metals/main/Media/Badge_MMP.png[/img]

A bunch of unofficial mod patches for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3333419387]Expanded Materials - Metals[/url]. I did my best to match that author's conventions: each building's Steel is split into the EMM metal that fits its role, with EMM's own percentages and cost factors.

[h1]Coverage[/h1]
89 buildings across 27 mods:
[list]
[*]Alpha Animals
[*]Alpha Biomes
[*]Centralized Climate Control (Continued)
[*]Dubs Bad Hygiene
[*]Dubs Rimatomics
[*]Expanded Prosthetics and Organ Engineering - Forked
[*]Hospitality: Vending machines
[*]LWM's Deep Storage
[*]Reel's Expanded Storage
[*]RimFridge: Now with Shelves!
[*]RimThunder - Core
[*][JDS] Simple Storage - Refrigeration
[*]Vanilla Brewing Expanded
[*]Vanilla Brewing Expanded - Coffees and Teas
[*]Vanilla Chemfuel Expanded
[*]Vanilla Cooking Expanded
[*]Vanilla Cooking Expanded - Haute
[*]Vanilla Cooking Expanded - Stews
[*]Vanilla Cooking Expanded - Sushi
[*]Vanilla Factions Expanded - Settlers
[*]Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Medical Module
[*]Vanilla Furniture Expanded - Production
[*]Vanilla Genetics Expanded
[*]Vanilla Nutrient Paste Expanded
[*]Vanilla Plants Expanded - More Plants
[*]Vanilla Quests Expanded - Drone Factory
[*]Warehouse Storage
[/list]
Full per-building list on [url=https://github.com/Sifu-Hotman/More-Mod-Patches-for-Expanded-Materials-Metals#coverage]GitHub[/url].

[h1]Requires / load order[/h1]
Argonic Core and Expanded Materials - Metals. Load this [b]after[/b] Expanded Materials - Metals and [b]after Combat Extended[/b]. If you also run [url=https://github.com/Sifu-Hotman/More-Mod-Patches-for-Expanded-Materials-Masonry]More Mod Patches for Expanded Materials - Masonry[/url], this one goes last:

Argonic Core -> Expanded Materials - Masonry -> Masonry mod patches -> Expanded Materials - Metals -> this mod

[h1]FAQ[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]CE compatible?[/b] Yes. Load this after CE.
[*][b]Add or remove mid-save?[/b] Yep.
[*][b]Balance?[/b] Same splits and factors EMM applies to its own buildings, nothing more.
[*][b]A mod you'd like covered?[/b] Open an issue on GitHub with the building names.
[/list]

[h1]AI[/h1]
This mod was engineered with the help of an AI coding assistant (Claude Code). Researching the compatibility interfaces of every patched mod would have been insurmountable without it. Development followed a standard process driven and scrutinized by me: explore, design, build, test, fix, review, test again over many rounds. I have manually reviewed and verified everything in this mod. If you have unconstructive feedback about the use of AI, please keep it outside this community space. Thank you.

